warning
# Issue #2312: the supervisor's boot-time pending-sync repair fired -- the
# checkout's HEAD and the orchestrator venv had drifted (a pre-#2312 deferred
# sync whose merge landed first, or a crash between merge and sync). One
# event per detected skew, whether the repair synced, deferred to live
# workers, or failed. Warning, not info: the skew existing at all means a
# deploy landed outside the deferred-ordering invariant, and that recurrence
# is the thing worth seeing -- a failed sync additionally puts the detail in
# the payload.
